      "text": {
        "en": "Owners frequently praise how calm and content their dogs remain during visits. Multiple clients note that anxious or matted pups were quickly put at ease and showed no signs of stress upon pickup. A single reviewer felt the groomer lacked patience with a restless senior dog, but most patrons emphasize compassionate treatment."
      }
