        "en": "Bright clean coats with mixed trims"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many customers rave about how wonderful their pets look and smell, mentioning soft white coats, neat breed styling, and smooth finishes. In contrast, two dissatisfied clients reported uneven haircuts, citing patchy facial trimming, remaining belly hair, or an unfinished groom on a difficult pet."
      }
    },
    {
