      "title": {
        "en": "Punctual turnaround with scheduling glitches"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients regularly appreciate the efficient turnaround times, noting that standard appointments take around ninety minutes with text notifications when pets are ready. Conversely, a couple of reviews mention appointment miscommunications or feeling that a cut was rushed without adequate attention to detail."
      }
